abstract: "Carrigan.Emailer is a configuration-driven email sender for .NET using MailKit. Supports SMTP network delivery and optional pickup-directory (.eml) output, multi-account grouping by host/sender, List-Unsubscribe header support, and ILogger-based diagnostics."
